<title>AUSTRALIA: Manettas returns to full year profit.</title>
<headline>Manettas returns to full year profit.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating		     profit 3.18 vs  loss 0.44</p>
<p>    Net			     profit 2.02 vs  loss 6.65</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)	     0.5  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     0.5  vs  nil</p>
<p>    Sales				  173.72 vs  170.19</p>
<p>    Other income			   5.85 vs    3.75</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    1.59 vs  loss 9.8</p>
<p>    Abnormal items		gain   0.11 vs  loss 6.89</p>
<p>Dividend is fully franked  </p>
<p>Pay date Sep 12</p>
<p>Reg date Aug 29</p>
<p>    Tax			    charge  1.27 vs  credit 0.68</p>
<p>    Interest				 0.02 vs  1.54</p>
<p>    Depreciation			   2.40 vs  1.82</p>
<p>    Minorities			     nil  vs  nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Manettas Ltd is a seafood supplier and is controlled by South Africa's Bidvest Group Ltd.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
